            "method": "HR-TEM, FFT",
            "source_text": "From the FFT results, it can be found that the surface phase transition of the cycled PIOBO-NCM811 and PIBBP-NCM811 particles Fig. 8b-c, region 2,3 is slighter from less layer to spinel, while the bulk region remains in the typical layered structure region 4. However, the phase transition of the cycled PVDF-NCM811 particles is from the typical layered to the rock-salt in the region 2 and 3 Fig. 8a, and the bulk region also turns to the electrochemically inactive spinel structure 54."
